  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "Inside Heavenly Court, Duke Long points to the sky and activates the immortal killer move Qi Breath Mountain. A huge translucent mountain made from qi currents descends and presses down at once. Several Northern Plains Gu Immortals who cannot dodge are crushed into meat paste as the mountain crashes toward Calamity Luck Altar, and the press immobilizes the altar.",
      "chapters": [
        1927
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "intro",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "fac_heavenly_court",
        "char_duke_long",
        "sys_killer_moves",
        "reg_northern_plains",
        "sys_gu_immortal",
        "house_calamity_luck_altar"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Duke Long gathers a grand qi current into a translucent mountain hundreds of li large and slams it toward Fang Yuan; Fang Yuan’s rampaging qi roar explodes the mountain and Duke Long takes backlash.",
      "chapters": [
        1935
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "fang-yuan-clash",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_fang_yuan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "In Duke Long’s qi path combat system, qi breath mountain sits among offensive killer moves with clearer long range power than his transformation path offense.",
      "chapters": [
        1945
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "qi-path-system",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "After triple qi retraction amplifies him, Duke Long forms an enormous translucent qi mountain that presses Di Zang Sheng’s head into the ground, then his surrounding qi falls sharply by thirty percent.",
      "chapters": [
        1950
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "amplified-recast",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_di_zang_sheng"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Qi Sea Ancestor activates Qi Breath Mountain as a huge translucent mountain of air currents that descends and presses down. The move was once used by Duke Long, belongs to Primordial Origin’s true inheritance, and once sent Purple Mountain True Monarch flying. Giant Spectral Soul blocks and breaks that mountain with many pairs of arms, and Qi Sea Ancestor is forced to retreat.",
      "chapters": [
        2051
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "citation_unchecked",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
